<title>UK: Bankgesellschaft unit sets 2.0 bln Lux franc bond.</title>
<headline>Bankgesellschaft unit sets 2.0 bln Lux franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Europeen, Banque Bruxelles Lambert SA and Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE IRELAND PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN, LANDESBANK BERLIN AND</p>
<p>		BERLINER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     *5.0	MATURITY    29.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.80    PAY DATE 05/06.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.28 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO YEAR THREE, THEN STEPS UP TO 6.0 PCT FOR YEARS</p>
<p>		 FOUR AND FIVE, AND 7.0 PCT THERAFTER</p>
<p>		 LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
